@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title Phase 1 Taxonomy And Policy Relationships

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor Maintainer
artifact "docs/reference/taxonomy.md\n57 human-readable artifact categories" as TaxonomyDoc
artifact "configs/quality.yaml\nIDs, coverage, quality policy" as QualityConfig
artifact "configs/task_categories.yaml\n5 behaviors and target distribution" as TaskConfig
artifact "configs/source_profiles.yaml\nsource/category eligibility" as SourceProfiles
artifact "synthesizers/prompts/categories/\nbehavior instructions" as CategoryPrompts
component "Phase 3 Planner" as Planner
component "Phase 3 + 4 Validators" as Validators
component "Coverage Audits" as Audits
database "Held-out benchmark" as Benchmark

Maintainer --> TaxonomyDoc: define subject coverage
Maintainer --> QualityConfig: mirror stable IDs and coverage
Maintainer --> TaskConfig: define learned behaviors
Maintainer --> SourceProfiles: map sources to behaviors
Maintainer --> CategoryPrompts: specify response behavior

TaxonomyDoc .. QualityConfig: human/machine views must agree
QualityConfig --> Validators
QualityConfig --> Audits
TaskConfig --> Planner
TaskConfig --> Audits
SourceProfiles --> Planner
CategoryPrompts --> Planner
Planner --> Benchmark: informs coverage, never supplies training cases

@enduml
